              "locked": false,
              "content": {
                "html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Every nuclear medicine examination is different, so it is important to read carefully any information provided by the department carrying out your scan or treatment.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Some procedures require special preparation, while others require very little preparation at all. Your appointment letter will explain exactly what you need to do before attending.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">If you have any questions before your appointment, please contact your Nuclear Medicine Department.</span></p>",
                "colorRole": "default",
