                  {
                    "a": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Your images will be reviewed by a specialist doctor or appropriately qualified Clinical Scientist.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A report is sent to the healthcare professional who referred you for the examination. They will discuss your results with you and explain what they mean for your care.</span></p>",
